# Phase 04: Manager-Authoritative Lifecycle, Tauri IPC, and Shutdown

## Context links

- [Plan](./plan.md)
- [Phase 01 ACL/platform gates](./phase-01-dependency-platform-gates.md)
- [Phase 02 contracts/storage](./phase-02-native-contracts-persistence.md)
